            </note>
            <note corresp="#d31-f3" n="28" xml:id="d31-f3-content">
                <p>Mr. Sadao Saburi, Chief of the Treaty Section, Japanese Foreign Office.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d31-f4" n="29" xml:id="d31-f4-content">
